    {
      "title": {
        "fi": "Lisätiedot",
        "sv": "Tilläggsuppgifter",
        "en": "Additional information"
      },
      "body": {
        "fi": "<p>Väkäkärsämadot luokitellaan samaan Syndermata-pääjaksoon rataseläimien (Rotifera) kanssa.</p><p>Malte Sielaff, Hanno Schmidt, Torsten H. Struck, David Rosenkranz, David B. Mark Welch, Thomas Hankeln, Holger Herlyn,</p><p>Phylogeny of Syndermata (syn. Rotifera): Mitochondrial gene order verifies epizoic Seisonidea as sister to endoparasitic Acanthocephala within monophyletic Hemirotifera, <a href=\"https://www.sciencedirect.com/science/article/pii/S105579031500370X#ab010\">Molecular Phylogenetics and Evolution,Volume 96,2016,Pages 79-92</a></p>"
      },
